{
  "text": "Zoe and Isaac live on Bryher, a small island. Their school is on nearby Tresco. Every morning, they meet the other children at the place where the boat stops. The boat journey takes only five minutes. Sometimes they see dolphins. After the boat arrives, they walk to school. For these children, going to class means crossing the sea.",
